{"id":"sauvage","lemma":"sauvage","pos":"adj","rank":1927,"glosses":["wild, untouched, unspoiled, pristine","wild, untamed, not domesticated (often used to qualify a wild alternative or pendant for a cultivated plant or domestic animal)","feral"],"ipa":"/so.vaʒ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/82/Fr-sauvage.ogg/Fr-sauvage.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"sauvages"},"formAudio":{"sauvages":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-sauvages.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il est assez sauvage.","en":"He is quite a savage.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to a sufficient or…"},null]},{"text":"Je crains les animaux sauvages.","en":"I'm afraid of wild animals.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to fear","l":"craindre"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"animal","l":"animal"},null]},{"text":"Je ne suis pas aussi sauvage que cela.","en":"I'm not that wild.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"too, also, as well"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Des animaux sauvages vivent dans la forêt.","en":"Wild animals live in the forest.","words":[{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"animal","l":"animal"},null,{"g":"to live","l":"vivre"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"forest"}]},{"text":"J'aime étudier les fleurs sauvages.","en":"I like studying wild flowers.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"to study"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"flower","l":"fleur"},null]}]}